"``license_files`` as it did previously, since Setuptools relies on its own "
"automatic inclusion of license-related files matching common patterns, such "
"as the :file:`LICENSE` file it uses."
msgstr ""
"Setuptools 项目本身自 `版本 75.6.0 <setuptools7560_>`__ 起就不再在自己的项目"
"源码元数据中使用 ``License`` 字段。此外，它也不再像以前那样显式指定 "
"``license_file``/``license_files``，因为 Setuptools 依靠自身的自动包含机制来"
"收录匹配常见模式的许可证相关文件，例如它所使用的 :file:`LICENSE` 文件。"

