"reference-label```\"), are not allowed here and will result in error "
"messages like \"``Error: Unknown interpreted text role \"py:func\".``\"."
msgstr ""
"请注意，文档字符串中所用的 Sphinx 扩展（例如 :doc:`指令 <sphinx:usage/"
