msgstr "或者使用 :file:`setup.py`："

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:142
msgid ""
":ref:`setuptools` will search the directory structure for implicit namespace "
"packages by default."
msgstr ":ref:`setuptools` 默认会在目录结构中搜索隐式命名空间包。"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:145
msgid ""
"A complete working example of two native namespace packages can be found in "
"the `native namespace package example project`_."
msgstr "两个原生命名空间包的完整可运行示例可以在 `原生命名空间包示例项目`_ 中找到。"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:151
msgid ""
"Because native and pkgutil-style namespace packages are largely compatible, "
"you can use native namespace packages in the distributions that only support "
"Python 3 and pkgutil-style namespace packages in the distributions that need "
"to support Python 2 and 3."
msgstr ""
"由于原生命名空间包与 pkgutil 风格命名空间包在很大程度上兼容，你可以在仅支持 "
"Python 3 的分发包中使用原生命名空间包，并在需要同时支持 Python 2 和 3 的分发"
"包中使用 pkgutil 风格命名空间包。"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:158
msgid "Legacy namespace packages"
msgstr "传统命名空间包"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:160
msgid ""
"These two methods, that were used to create namespace packages prior "
"to :pep:`420`, are now considered to be obsolete and should not be used "
"unless you need compatibility with packages already using one of these "
"methods."
msgstr ""
"这两种在 :pep:`420` 之前用于创建命名空间包的方法如今已被视为过时，除非你需要"
"与已经在使用其中某种方法的软件包保持兼容，否则不应再使用。"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:164
msgid ""
"To migrate an existing package, all packages sharing the namespace must be "
"migrated simultaneously."
msgstr "如果想要迁移某个现有软件包，所有共享该命名空间的软件包都必须同时迁移。"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:166
msgid ""
"While native namespace packages and pkgutil-style namespace packages are "
"largely compatible, pkg_resources-style namespace packages are not "
"compatible with the other methods. It's inadvisable to use different methods "
"in different distributions that provide packages to the same namespace."
msgstr ""
"虽然原生命名空间包与 pkgutil 风格命名空间包在很大程度上兼容，但 "
"pkg_resources 风格命名空间包与其他方法并不兼容。不建议在向同一命名空间提供软"
"件包的不同分发包中使用不同的方法。"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:173
msgid "pkgutil-style namespace packages"
msgstr "pkgutil 风格命名空间包"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:175
msgid ""
"Python 2.3 introduced the :doc:`pkgutil <python:library/pkgutil>` module and "
"the :py:func:`python:pkgutil.extend_path` function. This can be used to "
"declare namespace packages that need to be compatible with both Python 2.3+ "
"and Python 3. This was the recommended approach for the highest level of "
"compatibility."
msgstr ""
"Python 2.3 引入了 :doc:`pkgutil <python:library/pkgutil>` 模块和 "
":py:func:`python:pkgutil.extend_path` 函数。它可用于声明需要同时兼容 Python "
"2.3+ 和 Python 3 的命名空间包。这曾是获得最高兼容性水平的推荐方法。"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:180
msgid ""
"To create a pkgutil-style namespace package, you need to provide "
"an :file:`__init__.py` file for the namespace package:"
msgstr ""
"要创建 pkgutil 风格命名空间包，你需要为该命名空间包提供一个 "
