"following:"
msgstr "命名空间包的 :file:`__init__.py` 文件需要包含以下内容："

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:201
#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:256
msgid ""
"**Every** distribution that uses the namespace package must include such "
"an :file:`__init__.py`. If any distribution does not, it will cause the "
"namespace logic to fail and the other sub-packages will not be importable.  "
"Any additional code in :file:`__init__.py` will be inaccessible."
msgstr ""
"**每个** 使用该命名空间包的分发包都必须包含这样的 :file:`__init__.py`。只要有"
"任何分发包没有这样做，就会导致命名空间逻辑失效，其他子包将无法导入，而且 "
":file:`__init__.py` 中的任何附加代码都将无法访问。"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:206
msgid ""
"A complete working example of two pkgutil-style namespace packages can be "
"found in the `pkgutil namespace example project`_."
msgstr ""
"两个 pkgutil 风格命名空间包的完整可运行示例可以在 `pkgutil 命名空间示例项"
"目`_ 中找到。"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:216
msgid "pkg_resources-style namespace packages"
msgstr "pkg_resources 风格命名空间包"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:220
msgid ""
"The information in this section is obsolete and is no longer functional (as "
"of Setuptools 82.0.0). It is only retained for historical reference."
msgstr ""
"本节的信息已经过时，不再可用（自 Setuptools 82.0.0 起）。保留这些内容仅作历史"
"参考。"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:223
msgid ""
"``pkg_resources`` has been deprecated and was fully removed in Setuptools "
"82.0.0."
msgstr "``pkg_resources`` 已被弃用，并在 Setuptools 82.0.0 中被彻底移除。"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:225
msgid ""
":doc:`Setuptools <setuptools:index>` previously provided the "
"``pkg_resources.declare_namespace`` function and the ``namespace_packages`` "
"argument to :func:`~setuptools.setup`. Together these could be used to "
"declare namespace packages. While this approach is no longer supported, it "
"may still be encountered in environments using older ``setuptools`` "
"versions. If you are creating a new distribution within an existing "
"namespace package that uses this method then it's recommended to continue "
"using this as the different methods are not cross-compatible and it's not "
"advisable to try to migrate an existing package."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Setuptools <setuptools:index>` 此前提供了 "
"``pkg_resources.declare_namespace`` 函数，以及 :func:`~setuptools.setup` 的 "
"``namespace_packages`` 参数。两者结合可以用来声明命名空间包。虽然这种方式已不"
"再受支持，但在使用较旧 ``setuptools`` 版本的环境中仍可能遇到它。如果你要在采"
"用这种方法的现有命名空间包中创建新的分发包，建议继续沿用这种方式，因为各种方"
"法之间不能交叉兼容，而且不建议尝试迁移现有的软件包。"

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:235
msgid ""
"To create a pkg_resources-style namespace package, you need to provide "
"an :file:`__init__.py` file for the namespace package:"
msgstr ""
"要创建 pkg_resources 风格命名空间包，你需要为该命名空间包提供一个 "
":file:`__init__.py` 文件："

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:261
msgid ""
"Some older recommendations advise the following in the namespace "
"package :file:`__init__.py`:"
msgstr "一些较早的建议推荐在命名空间包的 :file:`__init__.py` 中写入以下内容："

#: ../source/guides/packaging-namespace-packages.rst:271
msgid ""
"The idea behind this was that in the rare case that setuptools isn't "
"available packages would fall-back to the pkgutil-style packages. This isn't "
"advisable because pkgutil and pkg_resources-style namespace packages are not "
"cross-compatible. If the presence of setuptools is a concern then the "
"package should just explicitly depend on setuptools via ``install_requires``."
msgstr ""
"这样做的用意是，在 setuptools 不可用的罕见情况下，软件包会回退到 pkgutil 风格"
"的软件包。这并不可取，因为 pkgutil 与 pkg_resources 风格命名空间包不能交叉兼"
"容。如果担心 setuptools 是否存在，软件包应当直接通过 ``install_requires`` 显"
"式声明对 setuptools 的依赖。"

