#: ../source/specifications/dependency-specifiers.rst:428
#: ../source/specifications/pylock-toml.rst:108
msgid "``extras``"
msgstr "``extras``"

#: ../source/specifications/dependency-specifiers.rst:429
msgid ""
"Used to indicate optional public dependencies in lock files. An error except "
"when defined by the context interpreting the specifier."
msgstr ""
"用于在锁定文件中指示公开的可选依赖项。除非由解释该说明符的上下文定义，否则即"
"为错误。"

#: ../source/specifications/dependency-specifiers.rst:431
