msgstr "否则，如果存在 :ref:`pylock-packages-wheels` 条目："

#: ../source/specifications/pylock-toml.rst:805
msgid ""
"Look for the appropriate wheel file based on :ref:`pylock-packages-wheels-"
"name`; if one is not found then move on to :ref:`pylock-packages-sdist` or "
"an error MUST be raised about a lack of source for the project."
msgstr ""
"根据 :ref:`pylock-packages-wheels-name` 查找合适的 wheel 文件；如果未找到，则"
"转向 :ref:`pylock-packages-sdist`，否则必须抛出错误，指出该项目缺少源代码。"

#: ../source/specifications/pylock-toml.rst:809
msgid "Get the file:"
msgstr "获取该文件："

