#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:78
msgid ""
"It's recommended to write ``{sys.executable}`` rather than plain ``python`` "
"in order to ensure that commands are run in the Python installation matching "
"the currently running notebook (which may not be the same Python "
"installation that the ``python`` command refers to)."
msgstr ""
"建议写 ``{sys.executable}`` 而不是简单的 ``python``，以确保命令在与当前正在运"
"行的 notebook 相匹配的 Python 安装环境中执行（``python`` 命令所指向的可能并不"
"是同一个 Python 安装环境）。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:83
msgid ""
"Due to the way most Linux distributions are handling the Python 3 migration, "
"Linux users using the system Python without creating a virtual environment "
"first should replace the ``python`` command in this tutorial with "
"``python3`` and the ``python -m pip`` command with ``python3 -m pip --"
"user``. Do *not* run any of the commands in this tutorial with ``sudo``: if "
"you get a permissions error, come back to the section on creating virtual "
"environments, set one up, and then continue with the tutorial as written."
msgstr ""
"由于大多数 Linux 发行版处理 Python 3 迁移的方式，在未先创建虚拟环境的情况下使"
"用系统 Python 的 Linux 用户，应将本教程中的 ``python`` 命令替换为 "
"``python3``，并将 ``python -m pip`` 命令替换为 ``python3 -m pip --user``。*切"
"勿* 使用 ``sudo`` 运行本教程中的任何命令：如果遇到权限错误，请回到创建虚拟环"
"境一节，先创建虚拟环境，然后按教程原文继续操作。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:95
msgid "Ensure you can run pip from the command line"
msgstr "请确保可以在命令行中运行 pip"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:97
msgid ""
"Additionally, you'll need to make sure you have :ref:`pip` available. You "
"can check this by running:"
msgstr "此外，你还需要确保 :ref:`pip` 可用。你可以运行以下命令来检查："

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:112
msgid ""
"If you installed Python from source, with an installer from `python.org`_, "
"or via `Homebrew`_ you should already have pip. If you're on Linux and "
"installed using your OS package manager, you may have to install pip "
"separately, see :doc:`/guides/installing-using-linux-tools`."
msgstr ""
"如果你是从源代码安装 Python、使用来自 `python.org`_ 的安装程序安装，或是通过 "
"`Homebrew`_ 安装的，那么你应该已经有了 pip。如果你在 Linux 上使用操作系统的软"
"件包管理器安装，则可能需要单独安装 pip，参见 :doc:`/guides/installing-using-"
"linux-tools`。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:119
msgid ""
"If ``pip`` isn't already installed, then first try to bootstrap it from the "
"standard library:"
msgstr "如果尚未安装 ``pip``，请先尝试从标准库引导安装："

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:134
msgid "If that still doesn't allow you to run ``python -m pip``:"
msgstr "如果这样仍然无法运行 ``python -m pip``："

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:136
msgid ""
"Securely Download `get-pip.py <https://bootstrap.pypa.io/get-pip.py>`_ [1]_"
msgstr "安全地下载 `get-pip.py <https://bootstrap.pypa.io/get-pip.py>`_ [1]_"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:139
msgid ""
"Run ``python get-pip.py``. [2]_  This will install or upgrade pip. "
"Additionally, it may install :ref:`setuptools` and :ref:`wheel` if they're "
"not installed already."
msgstr ""
"运行 ``python get-pip.py``。[2]_ 这将安装或升级 pip。此外，如果 "
":ref:`setuptools` 和 :ref:`wheel` 尚未安装，它还可能安装这两个软件包。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:145
msgid ""
"Be cautious if you're using a Python install that's managed by your "
"operating system or another package manager. get-pip.py does not coordinate "
"with those tools, and may leave your system in an inconsistent state. You "
"can use ``python get-pip.py --prefix=/usr/local/`` to install in ``/usr/"
"local`` which is designed for locally-installed software."
msgstr ""
"如果你使用的 Python 安装由操作系统或其他软件包管理器管理，请谨慎操作。get-"
"pip.py 不会与这些工具协调，可能会使你的系统处于不一致的状态。你可以使用 "
"``python get-pip.py --prefix=/usr/local/`` 安装到 ``/usr/local``，该目录是专"
"为本地安装的软件设计的。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:154
msgid "Ensure pip is up to date"
msgstr "请确保 pip 为最新版本"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:156
msgid ""
"Make sure you have the latest features and fixes, and support for the latest "
"Python packaging specifications."
msgstr "确保你获得最新的功能和修复，以及对最新 Python 打包规范的支持。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:172
msgid "Optionally, create a virtual environment"
msgstr "（可选）创建虚拟环境"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:174
msgid ""
"See :ref:`section below <Creating and using Virtual Environments>` for "
"details, but here's the basic :doc:`venv <python:library/venv>` [3]_ command "
"to use on a typical Linux system:"
msgstr ""
"详细信息请参见 :ref:`下文 <Creating and using Virtual Environments>`，以下是"
"在典型 Linux 系统上使用的基本 :doc:`venv <python:library/venv>` [3]_ 命令："

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:191
msgid ""
"This will create a new virtual environment in the ``tutorial_env`` "
"subdirectory, and configure the current shell to use it as the default "
"``python`` environment."
msgstr ""
"这将在 ``tutorial_env`` 子目录中创建一个新的虚拟环境，并配置当前 shell 将其作"
"为默认的 ``python`` 环境。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:198
msgid "Creating Virtual Environments"
msgstr "创建虚拟环境"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:200
msgid ""
"Python \"Virtual Environments\" allow Python :term:`packages <Distribution "
"Package>` to be installed in an isolated location for a particular "
"application, rather than being installed globally. If you are looking to "
"safely install global command line tools, see :doc:`/guides/installing-stand-"
"alone-command-line-tools`."
msgstr ""
"Python 的“虚拟环境”（Virtual Environments）允许将 Python :term:`分发包 "
"<Distribution Package>` 安装在针对特定应用的隔离位置，而不是全局安装。如果你"
"想安全地安装全局命令行工具，请参见 :doc:`/guides/installing-stand-alone-"
"command-line-tools`。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:206
msgid ""
"Imagine you have an application that needs version 1 of LibFoo, but another "
"application requires version 2. How can you use both these applications? If "
"you install everything into /usr/lib/python3.6/site-packages (or whatever "
"your platform’s standard location is), it’s easy to end up in a situation "
"where you unintentionally upgrade an application that shouldn’t be upgraded."
msgstr ""
"假设你有一个应用需要 LibFoo 的版本 1，而另一个应用需要版本 2。如何同时使用这"
"两个应用？如果将所有内容都安装到 /usr/lib/python3.6/site-packages（或你所使用"
"平台的标准位置）中，就很容易在无意中升级了本不应该升级的应用。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:212
msgid ""
"Or more generally, what if you want to install an application and leave it "
"be? If an application works, any change in its libraries or the versions of "
"those libraries can break the application."
msgstr ""
"或者更一般地说，如果你想安装一个应用后就不再去动它呢？如果一个应用能正常工作"
"，其依赖库或这些库版本的任何变化都可能破坏该应用。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:216
msgid ""
"Also, what if you can’t install :term:`packages <Distribution Package>` into "
"the global site-packages directory? For instance, on a shared host."
msgstr ""
"另外，如果你无法将 :term:`分发包 <Distribution Package>` 安装到全局 site-"
"packages 目录中怎么办？例如在共享主机上。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:219
msgid ""
"In all these cases, virtual environments can help you. They have their own "
"installation directories and they don’t share libraries with other virtual "
"environments."
msgstr ""
"在所有这些情况下，虚拟环境都能帮到你。它们有自己的安装目录，并且不与其他虚拟"
"环境共享库。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:223
msgid ""
"Currently, there are two common tools for creating Python virtual "
"environments:"
msgstr "目前，创建 Python 虚拟环境有两种常用工具："

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:225
msgid ""
":doc:`venv <python:library/venv>` is available by default in Python 3.3 and "
"later, and installs :ref:`pip` into created virtual environments in Python "
"3.4 and later (Python versions prior to 3.12 also "
"installed :ref:`setuptools`)."
msgstr ""
":doc:`venv <python:library/venv>` 在 Python 3.3 及更高版本中默认可用，并且在 "
"Python 3.4 及更高版本中会将 :ref:`pip` 安装到所创建的虚拟环境中（3.12 之前的 "
"Python 版本还会安装 :ref:`setuptools`）。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:228
msgid ""
":ref:`virtualenv` needs to be installed separately, but supports Python 2.7+ "
"and Python 3.3+, and :ref:`pip`, :ref:`setuptools` and :ref:`wheel` are "
"installed into created virtual environments by default. Note that "
"``setuptools`` is no longer included by default starting with Python 3.12 "
"(and ``virtualenv`` follows this behavior)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`virtualenv` 需要单独安装，但支持 Python 2.7+ 和 Python 3.3+，并且默认会"
"将 :ref:`pip`、:ref:`setuptools` 和 :ref:`wheel` 安装到所创建的虚拟环境中。请"
"注意，从 Python 3.12 开始默认不再包含 ``setuptools``，``virtualenv`` 也遵循此"
"行为。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:233
msgid "The basic usage is like so:"
msgstr "基本用法如下："

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:235
msgid "Using :doc:`venv <python:library/venv>`:"
msgstr "使用 :doc:`venv <python:library/venv>`："

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:251
msgid "Using :ref:`virtualenv`:"
msgstr "使用 :ref:`virtualenv`："

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:267
msgid ""
"For more information, see the :doc:`venv <python:library/venv>` docs or "
"the :doc:`virtualenv <virtualenv:index>` docs."
msgstr ""
"更多信息，请参见 :doc:`venv <python:library/venv>` 文档或 :doc:`virtualenv "
"<virtualenv:index>` 文档。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:270
msgid ""
"The use of :command:`source` under Unix shells ensures that the virtual "
"environment's variables are set within the current shell, and not in a "
"subprocess (which then disappears, having no useful effect)."
msgstr ""
"在 Unix shell 下使用 :command:`source` 可以确保虚拟环境的变量在当前 shell 中"
"设置，而不是在子进程中设置（子进程随后就会消失，不会产生任何实际效果）。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:275
msgid ""
"In both of the above cases, Windows users should *not* use "
"the :command:`source` command, but should rather run the :command:`activate` "
"script directly from the command shell like so:"
msgstr ""
"在上述两种情况下，Windows 用户 *切勿* 使用 :command:`source` 命令，而应直接在"
"命令 shell 中运行 :command:`activate` 脚本，如下所示："

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:285
msgid ""
"Managing multiple virtual environments directly can become tedious, so "
"the :ref:`dependency management tutorial <managing-dependencies>` introduces "
"a higher level tool, :ref:`Pipenv`, that automatically manages a separate "
"virtual environment for each project and application that you work on."
msgstr ""
"直接管理多个虚拟环境可能会变得繁琐，因此 :ref:`依赖管理教程 <managing-"
"dependencies>` 引入了一个更高级的工具 :ref:`Pipenv`，它会为你参与的每个项目和"
"应用自动管理独立的虚拟环境。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:292
msgid "Use pip for Installing"
msgstr "使用 pip 安装"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:294
msgid ""
":ref:`pip` is the recommended installer.  Below, we'll cover the most common "
"usage scenarios. For more detail, see the :doc:`pip docs <pip:index>`, which "
"includes a complete :doc:`Reference Guide <pip:cli/index>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`pip` 是推荐的安装工具。下面我们将介绍最常见的使用场景。更多详细信息，请"
"参见 :doc:`pip 文档 <pip:index>`，其中包含完整的 :doc:`参考指南 <pip:cli/"
"index>`。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:300
msgid "Installing from PyPI"
msgstr "从 PyPI 安装"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:302
msgid ""
"The most common usage of :ref:`pip` is to install from the :term:`Python "
"Package Index <Python Package Index (PyPI)>` using a :term:`requirement "
"specifier <Requirement Specifier>`. Generally speaking, a requirement "
"specifier is composed of a project name followed by an "
"optional :term:`version specifier <Version Specifier>`.  A full description "
"of the supported specifiers can be found in the :ref:`Version specifier "
"specification <version-specifiers>`. Below are some examples."
msgstr ""
":ref:`pip` 最常见的用法是使用 :term:`需求说明符 <Requirement Specifier>` 从 "
":term:`Python 包索引 <Python Package Index (PyPI)>` 安装。一般来说，需求说明"
"符由项目名称加上可选的 :term:`版本说明符 <Version Specifier>` 组成。有关受支"
"持说明符的完整描述，请参见 :ref:`版本说明符规范 <version-specifiers>`。下面是"
"一些示例。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:310
msgid "To install the latest version of \"SomeProject\":"
msgstr "安装“SomeProject”的最新版本："

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:324
msgid "To install a specific version:"
msgstr "安装特定版本："

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:338
msgid "To install greater than or equal to one version and less than another:"
msgstr "安装大于等于某一版本且小于另一版本的版本："

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:353
msgid ""
"To install a version that's :ref:`compatible <version-specifiers-compatible-"
"release>` with a certain version: [4]_"
msgstr ""
"安装与某一版本 :ref:`兼容 <version-specifiers-compatible-release>` 的版本"
"：[4]_"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:368
msgid ""
"In this case, this means to install any version \"==1.4.*\" version that's "
"also \">=1.4.2\"."
msgstr "在本例中，这意味着安装任意同时满足“==1.4.*”和“>=1.4.2”的版本。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:373
msgid "Source Distributions vs Wheels"
msgstr "源分发与 wheel 包"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:375
msgid ""
":ref:`pip` can install from either :term:`Source Distributions (sdist) "
"<Source Distribution (or \"sdist\")>` or :term:`Wheels <Wheel>`, but if both "
"are present on PyPI, pip will prefer a compatible :term:`wheel <Wheel>`. You "
"can override pip`s default behavior by e.g. using its :ref:`--no-binary "
"<pip:install_--no-binary>` option."
msgstr ""
":ref:`pip` 既可以从 :term:`源分发（sdist）<Source Distribution (or "
"\"sdist\")>` 安装，也可以从 :term:`wheel 包 <Wheel>` 安装；但如果 PyPI 上两者"
"同时存在，pip 将优先选择兼容的 :term:`wheel <Wheel>`。你可以通过例如使用 pip "
"的 :ref:`--no-binary <pip:install_--no-binary>` 选项来覆盖其默认行为。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:381
msgid ""
":term:`Wheels <Wheel>` are a pre-built :term:`distribution <Distribution "
"Package>` format that provides faster installation compared to :term:`Source "
"Distributions (sdist) <Source Distribution (or \"sdist\")>`, especially when "
"a project contains compiled extensions."
msgstr ""
":term:`wheel 包 <Wheel>` 是一种预构建的 :term:`分发包 <Distribution Package>"
"` 格式，与 :term:`源分发（sdist）<Source Distribution (or \"sdist\")>` 相比可"
"提供更快的安装速度，尤其是当项目包含已编译的扩展时。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:386
msgid ""
"If :ref:`pip` does not find a wheel to install, it will locally build a "
"wheel and cache it for future installs, instead of rebuilding the source "
"distribution in the future."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`pip` 没有找到可安装的 wheel，它会在本地构建一个 wheel 并将其缓存以"
"供将来安装使用，而不是在将来重新构建源分发。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:394
msgid "Upgrade an already installed ``SomeProject`` to the latest from PyPI."
msgstr "将已安装的 ``SomeProject`` 升级到 PyPI 上的最新版本。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:411
msgid "Installing to the User Site"
msgstr "安装到用户站点"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:413
msgid ""
"To install :term:`packages <Distribution Package>` that are isolated to the "
"current user, use the ``--user`` flag:"
msgstr ""
"要安装仅对当前用户生效的 :term:`分发包 <Distribution Package>`，请使用 ``--"
"user`` 标志："

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:428
msgid ""
"For more information see the `User Installs <https://pip.pypa.io/en/latest/"
"user_guide/#user-installs>`_ section from the pip docs."
msgstr ""
"更多信息，请参见 pip 文档中的 `User Installs <https://pip.pypa.io/en/latest/"
"user_guide/#user-installs>`_ 一节。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:432
msgid ""
"Note that the ``--user`` flag has no effect when inside a virtual "
"environment - all installation commands will affect the virtual environment."
msgstr ""
"请注意，在虚拟环境中时 ``--user`` 标志无效——所有安装命令都将作用于该虚拟环境"
"。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:435
msgid ""
"If ``SomeProject`` defines any command-line scripts or console entry points, "
"``--user`` will cause them to be installed inside the `user base`_'s binary "
"directory, which may or may not already be present in your "
"shell's :envvar:`PATH`.  (Starting in version 10, pip displays a warning "
"when installing any scripts to a directory outside :envvar:`PATH`.)  If the "
"scripts are not available in your shell after installation, you'll need to "
"add the directory to your :envvar:`PATH`:"
msgstr ""
"如果 ``SomeProject`` 定义了命令行脚本或控制台入口点，``--user`` 会使它们被安"
"装到 `user base`_ 的二进制目录中，而该目录可能已经在你 shell 的 "
":envvar:`PATH` 中，也可能不在。（从版本 10 开始，pip 在将脚本安装到 "
":envvar:`PATH` 之外的目录时会显示警告。）如果安装后这些脚本在你的 shell 中不"
"可用，你需要将该目录添加到 :envvar:`PATH` 中："

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:443
msgid ""
"On Linux and macOS you can find the user base binary directory by running "
"``python -m site --user-base`` and adding ``bin`` to the end. For example, "
"this will typically print ``~/.local`` (with ``~`` expanded to the absolute "
"path to your home directory) so you'll need to add ``~/.local/bin`` to your "
"``PATH``.  You can set your ``PATH`` permanently by `modifying ~/.profile`_."
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 和 macOS 上，你可以运行 ``python -m site --user-base`` 并在末尾加上 "
"``bin`` 来找到 user base 二进制目录。例如，它通常会输出 ``~/.local``，其中 "
"``~`` 会展开为你的主目录的绝对路径，因此你需要将 ``~/.local/bin`` 添加到 "
"``PATH`` 中。你可以通过 `修改 ~/.profile`_ 来永久设置 ``PATH``。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:449
msgid ""
"On Windows you can find the user base binary directory by running ``py -m "
"site --user-site`` and replacing ``site-packages`` with ``Scripts``. For "
"example, this could return ``C:"
"\\Users\\Username\\AppData\\Roaming\\Python36\\site-packages`` so you would "
"need to set your ``PATH`` to include ``C:"
"\\Users\\Username\\AppData\\Roaming\\Python36\\Scripts``. You can set your "
"user ``PATH`` permanently in the `Control Panel`_. You may need to log out "
"for the ``PATH`` changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，你可以运行 ``py -m site --user-site`` 并将 ``site-packages`` "
"替换为 ``Scripts`` 来找到 user base 二进制目录。例如，它可能返回 ``C:\\U"
"sers\\Username\\AppData\\Roaming\\Python36\\site-packages``，那么你需要将 "
"``C:\\Users\\Username\\AppData\\Roaming\\Python36\\Scripts`` 包含到 ``PATH`` "
"中。你可以在 `控制面板`_ 中永久设置用户 ``PATH``。可能需要注销后 ``PATH`` 的"
"更改才会生效。"

#: ../source/tutorials/installing-packages.rst:465
msgid ""
"Install a list of requirements specified in a :ref:`Requirements File "
"<pip:Requirements Files>`."
msgstr "安装 :ref:`需求文件 <pip:Requirements Files>` 中指定的需求列表。"

